        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">1</span></p><p><em>You stand firm, locking eyes with your opponent and speaking a challenge with unnerving calm.</em></p><p>Spend 1 focus to make a <strong>Discipline</strong> test against the Spiritual defense of an enemy you can influence. On a success, they become <strong>Disoriented</strong> and gain a disadvantage on tests against you until the end of their next turn.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">1</span></p><p>Spend 1 focus to test <strong>Discipline</strong> vs. an enemy’s Spiritual. On success, they are <strong>Disoriented</strong> and gain a disadvantage on tests against you.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"One Action\" aria-label=\"One Action\">1</span></p><p>Spend 1 focus to make a <strong>Discipline</strong> test against the Spiritual defense of an enemy you can influence. On a success, they become <strong>Disoriented</strong> and gain a disadvantage on tests against you until the end of their next turn.</p>"
